<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NIKE EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NIKE EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co said analyst Patrick Snell increased his earnings estimates for NIKE Inc to $2.80 per share from $2.62 for fiscal 1997, ending in May, and to $3.50 from $3.10 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- Snell said &quot;strength of...fiscal 1997 product lineup, aggressive marketing program, and dependable service levels&quot; should help build upon 41 percent share in the domestic athletic footwear market.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 5-7/8 to 61.</p>
</text>
